### Create a user
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users?organizationId=11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jane.doe@resolve.com",
  "username": "jane.doe",
  "fullName": "Jane Doe",
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### List users for that organization
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users?organizationId=11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111